<Layout title="Our story" description="Meet Sigura Construction, the Bay Area residential and commercial builder founded by Ilan Sigura, serving homeowners since 2003." hero="stairs">
<Hero eyebrow="Our story / Since 2003" title={'Built on craft.\nCentered on people.'} image="stairs"/>
<section class="section introduction"><div><p class="eyebrow">A Bay Area story</p><h2>Good building<br/>starts with<br/><em>understanding.</em></h2></div><div><p class="large-copy">A home should reflect the people who live in it. That conviction is at the heart of this design-build experience.</p><p>Founded by Ilan Sigura, Sigura Construction has served Bay Area homeowners since 2003. The company’s work spans residential and commercial construction, from kitchen and bathroom remodels to additions and new homes.</p><p>A thoughtful result depends on the decisions along the way: understanding the brief, considering the whole space, and giving each detail the attention it deserves.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('process/')}>Explore the project journey <span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="about-statement section"><span>2003</span><h2>A local beginning.<br/><em>A lasting commitment.</em></h2><p>From a one-person operation to a construction team serving the Peninsula and South Bay, Sigura’s story is rooted in the communities where it builds.</p></section>
<section class="section team-section"><div><p class="eyebrow">The people behind the work</p><h2>Meet the team.</h2><p>The company’s published team introduces the people helping guide its projects.</p></div><div class="team-list"><div><h3>Ilan Sigura</h3><p>CEO & General Contractor</p></div><div><h3>Chris Boyer</h3><p>Production Manager</p></div><div><h3>Adi Lee-Lev</h3><p>Project Manager, Estimator</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section credential-details"><div><p class="eyebrow">A foundation of trust</p><h2>Look closer.<br/><em>Build with confidence.</em></h2></div><div><p>California contractor license #865155. Business history dating to 2003. Published recognition and independent profiles you can explore.</p><a class="text-link" href={url('awards/')}>Recognition & credentials <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href={url('reviews/')}>Read homeowner experiences <span>↗</span></a></div></section><CTA/>
